# Hermes overnight-agent scratch output. NARROWED 2026-08-16 (P10-04 hygiene
# finding): the original blanket `handoff/` rule silently swallowed real,
# permanent deliverables (reports cited as evidence by other tracked docs) at
# least 4 separate times this sprint -- 11 files total force-added back after
# the fact. Markdown reports are the actual deliverable and are tracked by
# default now; only genuine scratch/log/generated output stays ignored.
# See docs/ops/hermes/README.md.
handoff/*.log
handoff/*.txt
handoff/*.stderr
handoff/*.json
handoff/_*
handoff/*.py
